---
---

<div class="exportar solo-pantalla">
  <div class="exportar__texto">
    <strong>¿Lista la cotización?</strong>
    <span>Se abre en una pestaña nueva como PDF A4, con el texto seleccionable.</span>
  </div>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn--principal btn--grande js-exportar-pdf">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true">
      <path
        d="M10 3v9m0 0 3.5-3.5M10 12 6.5 8.5M4 14v2.5h12V14"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.8"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
    </svg>
    Exportar a PDF
  </button>
</div>

<style>
  .exportar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 18px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 4px;
    padding: 16px 18px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--accent-050);
  }

  .exportar__texto {
    display: grid;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .exportar__texto strong {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--brand-900);
  }

  .exportar__texto span {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .btn--grande {
    padding: 12px 24px;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .btn[disabled] {
    opacity: 0.65;
    cursor: progress;
  }
</style>
